A narrow stair descends into a black-stone vault beneath the northern royal rank. Cobalt ward-runes crawl across fitted blocks while sealed niches hold tribute gathered during forgotten ages of the Game. Broken crownstones and ancient victory tablets line the walls around the surviving royal hoard. The chamber feels less like a treasury than the sealed memory of a kingdom that no longer exists outside the board.
~
